                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Zomato's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Multi-line platform — restaurant discovery + food delivery + Blinkit quick commerce + Hyperpure B2B. Category-leadership + expansion into adjacent categories.</p>
                                        <h3>Zomato vs Swiggy?</h3>
                                        <p>Duopoly food delivery. Different strengths — Zomato brand + creative + Blinkit. Swiggy Instamart + logistics. Both major food-tech leaders.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new food-tech platforms compete?</h3>
                                        <p>In specific niching — vertical-specific (specific cuisine + specific dietary + specific geography). Massive category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest food-tech lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Discovery + delivery + quick commerce + B2B multi-line expansion + brand + creative + acquisition-based growth combined.</p>
